{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Torchlight: Infinite\u2019s \u201cOutlaw\u201d Season Officially Launches on July 17!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Seasonal Mechanic: Outlaw  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This season introduces &quot;Outlaw,&quot; a high-stakes, risk-reward system designed to increase excitement throughout the Netherrealm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Progression System: TOWER Sequence </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The TOWER Sequence is a deep, new progression vector that adds extensive customization to weapons and shields. You can even replicate and modify the exclusive mechanics of some Legendary gear !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Hero Trait: Rosa | Unsullied Blade</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosa\u2019s Mana progression now fuels her elemental attacks. By accumulating &quot;Mercury Value,&quot; she deploys an expanding Mystic Mercury realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first time a magic progression system has been introduced to a damage-focused trait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Event:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you complete the main story and clear specific Timemarks in the Netherrealm, you can claim free Pactspirits. This includes fan-favorites like Happy Chonky, Cloudgatherer - Surging Gold, and Winter Darer - Sky, as well as a <strong>Legendary Battle Pactspirit of your choice</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST &amp; THRILLING Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no stamina and no cooldowns, smash down incoming waves with melee attacks, blast off magical explosions and draining pools, or snipe down ranged enemies. Grind with your own battle style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect ENDLESS Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited drops from battles to upgrade build styles and establish your own collection. Prove your grind power by showing off in the in-game free market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build UNLIMITED Playstyles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique heroes, 24 talent tabs, 200+ legendary gears, 240+ powerful skills, Try out infinite playstyles or strategic possibilities on hero builds. Build your very own hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade AT WILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Trade house to be a part of a booming economy with an infinite amount of hero builds to trade. One hunter's trash might be another hunter's treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"There were heavy casualties, but we managed to save the Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/419abced7113572d56814b1abd0d49b216581f72.jpg"},{"name":"I beat up Keegan in the academy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/0bd1483ed75e4e7c952a3430bcc685f02d0a5061.jpg"},{"name":"I fought a dragon in the desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/7a1336286e8637d6ebce29f721fd14435efc9e8b.jpg"},{"name":"Now I'm finally invincible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/f009b525180199145f6b94ab12b699c6262868f3.jpg"},{"name":"Do you think I can conjure flames out of thin air?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/b11aa6ce5a2212e4a3a8176010e5e8affbdff5a9.jpg"},{"name":"Dreams have everything, and I mean EVERYTHING!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/147245dfbf00bda2101c6e1d407156a681ba53b8.jpg"},{"name":"I'll do anything for Double Corrosion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/f44c4ca655e57aa444bc6655540c01964e5f23d4.jpg"},{"name":"Give me some Ember","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/14001945b38a480acbac583bc5db67da7f7aa352.jpg"},{"name":"You look really handsome when you charge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/8b9b93aa9b053309f4e2cffacbe677d0f1ac9639.jpg"},{"name":"If you're the boss, then who am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/47c41a09590892124fbc444e927ffb6cd9fbb412.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1974050?t=1760065642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760065642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/6c0bb3668b9e3d3da12b84b47abf16334d471b17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760065642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/6c0bb3668b9e3d3da12b84b47abf16334d471b17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760065642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US ON DISOCRD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Torchlight: Infinite\u2019s \u201cOutlaw\u201d Season Officially Launches on July 17!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Seasonal Mechanic: Outlaw  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This season introduces &quot;Outlaw,&quot; a high-stakes, risk-reward system designed to increase excitement throughout the Netherrealm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Progression System: TOWER Sequence </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The TOWER Sequence is a deep, new progression vector that adds extensive customization to weapons and shields. You can even replicate and modify the exclusive mechanics of some Legendary gear !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Hero Trait: Rosa | Unsullied Blade</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosa\u2019s Mana progression now fuels her elemental attacks. By accumulating &quot;Mercury Value,&quot; she deploys an expanding Mystic Mercury realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first time a magic progression system has been introduced to a damage-focused trait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Event:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you complete the main story and clear specific Timemarks in the Netherrealm, you can claim free Pactspirits. This includes fan-favorites like Happy Chonky, Cloudgatherer - Surging Gold, and Winter Darer - Sky, as well as a <strong>Legendary Battle Pactspirit of your choice</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST &amp; THRILLING Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no stamina and no cooldowns, smash down incoming waves with melee attacks, blast off magical explosions and draining pools, or snipe down ranged enemies. Grind with your own battle style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect ENDLESS Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited drops from battles to upgrade build styles and establish your own collection. Prove your grind power by showing off in the in-game free market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build UNLIMITED Playstyles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique heroes, 24 talent tabs, 200+ legendary gears, 240+ powerful skills, Try out infinite playstyles or strategic possibilities on hero builds. Build your very own hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade AT WILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Trade house to be a part of a booming economy with an infinite amount of hero builds to trade. One hunter's trash might be another hunter's treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.poster.avif?t=1760065642\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.webm?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.mp4?t=1760065642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["XD"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Since Torchlight Infinite is a cross-platform game on both PC and mobile, the game will require users to bind 3rd party account in order to login like TapTap. ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/93281f3bc6def76576d26df0bf8faae8cde7c28e/header.jpg?t=1760065642","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1974050/1202542850/6250fae80a26927dd9474c35dfa532de93aedac6/1760064686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760065639","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1974050/1202542850/6250fae80a26927dd9474c35dfa532de93aedac6/1760064686/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760065639","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/19